{"3585400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Steal The Pig", "steam_appid": 3585400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEAL THE PIG — a cooperative platformer where you play as two thieves trying to steal a pig. Be careful, because this pig isn’t one who enjoys traveling! Try not to wake it up or let it escape! Get ready for tons of fun, unexpected situations, and a real test of teamwork.  <br>The game is inspired by projects like Split Fiction, It Takes Two, and Chained Together, but with a unique atmosphere and its own approach to co-op.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/c69c71e2d602dd5695c653da3769a600.poster.avif?t=1753377734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/c69c71e2d602dd5695c653da3769a600.webm?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/c69c71e2d602dd5695c653da3769a600.mp4?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Single-player, split-screen, and multiplayer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in split-screen mode on one device, or invite a reliable friend to an online lobby to steal the pig together! Teamwork will help you overcome all challenges and deliver the pig safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/44b7332e3d84a9813212c8f70794929d.poster.avif?t=1753377734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/44b7332e3d84a9813212c8f70794929d.webm?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/44b7332e3d84a9813212c8f70794929d.mp4?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traps and puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll encounter traps and puzzles that will test your skills and reflexes. Bravely solve challenges and avoid dangers to successfully deliver the pig!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/1b6e45b62a0da8a766fa47bb0feb8802.poster.avif?t=1753377734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/1b6e45b62a0da8a766fa47bb0feb8802.webm?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/1b6e45b62a0da8a766fa47bb0feb8802.mp4?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover mini-games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the map to find and unlock fun and unexpected mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/85f589889afcd60daaed5a07a76797d9.poster.avif?t=1753377734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/85f589889afcd60daaed5a07a76797d9.webm?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/85f589889afcd60daaed5a07a76797d9.mp4?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics at every step</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, everything works according to the laws of physics: mass, inertia, collisions—it all matters! This makes the game not only exciting but truly unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/c86a3c4abe31f94aee70eec88ac7f1b1.poster.avif?t=1753377734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/c86a3c4abe31f94aee70eec88ac7f1b1.webm?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/c86a3c4abe31f94aee70eec88ac7f1b1.mp4?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Variety of costumes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the costumes—search for and gather unique outfits hidden in the most unexpected corners of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/d8e475bb76a6243f3f69421c8c79c311.poster.avif?t=1753377734\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/d8e475bb76a6243f3f69421c8c79c311.webm?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/d8e475bb76a6243f3f69421c8c79c311.mp4?t=1753377734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/cfcf7146ae8ea7a03a94388b29545ade.poster.avif?t=1753377734\" width=800 height=84 ><source src=\"htt